'''Otto's Irresistible Box''' was a limited time offer [[DDO Store]] item bundle offered for {{Cost|4995|inline=true}} from:{{Br}}{{Hlist|tab=5|December 14-20, 2012|February 15-28, 2013|May 3-13, 2013|August 9-18, 2013|September 20–29, 2013}}
{{-}}
[[File:Otto's Irresistible Box.png|thumb]]
The Otto's Irresistible Box contains:
* {{Item|Stone of Experience}}
* {{Item|Experience_Elixir#Superior_Experience_Elixir|5 Superior Experience Elixirs}}
* {{Item|Slayer_Count_Boost#Major_Slayer_Count_Boost|5 Major Slayer Count Boosts}}
* {{Item|Jewel_of_Fortune#Huge_Jewel_of_Fortune|5 Huge Jewels of Fortune}}
* {{Item|Siberys_Spirit_Cake#Siberys_Spirit_Cake|5 Siberys Spirit Cakes}}
* {{Item|Siberys_Spirit_Cake#Greater_Siberys_Spirit_Cake|3 Greater Siberys Spirit Cakes}}
* A choice of either {{AS|65|textonly=true}} or a {{Item|Cyan Gelatinous Cube Creature Companion}}.

All of the gear and the Major Slayer Count Boosts are {{Bind|BtC|BoA}}. All of the other consumables are {{Bind|BtA|BoA}}.

